Sorry, the Wizard is able to teleport very effectively.  If you move away from
him, he'll teleport in front of you again.  If you escape the level, he'll
hunt you down and appear at a later level.  Personally I have never used the
potion trick, since by the time I meet the dude I can kick his but in a few
hacks.  He has never posed any real threat.

